                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game plays like a mobile clicker, not a strategy simulation game. For the first hour, you're left with nothing to do but click on a boat every minute or so. If you continue, it's advertised to have more content, however, it takes too long with boring clicker mechanics to get there. Additionally, the late game appears to be functionally the same. If you  are looking for a clicker, I still think there'd be better, more rewarding options.",
